      {
        "id": "repetition-cost",
        "moduleId": "repetition-problem",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "同一个程序名出现四次",
        "markdown": "完成前几节的规则后，`bin/countwords.py` 这个程序名在 Makefile 中一共出现了四次：两条规则各把它列为依赖，两条命令各用它启动脚本。程序一旦改名或换到别的目录，就要逐一找到并替换每一处出现，漏改一处就会让某条规则继续调用旧路径。\n\n教材把这种重复类比为程序里散落的魔法数字：读者看到两个相同的字面量时，必须自己判断它们是否真的应当永远相同，Makefile 因此更难理解。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-dacd3293b5aedfe0e5a195bd",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000058"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Automating Analyses with Make",
                "Reducing Repetition in a Makefile"
              ],
              "lineStart": 5542,
              "lineEnd": 5606,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "e75cc3035dab32cc67d14b496965e3405aedd8748e67a71c981578f636ebcaa9"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "repetition-risk",
        "moduleId": "repetition-problem",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "补充：重复把一致性约束留给了读者",
        "markdown": "重复真正的代价不是多敲几个字符，而是把「这几处必须保持一致」这条约束留在了读者和修改者的脑子里，Make 本身不会检查它。两处字面量一旦不一致，make 仍可能正常执行，只是某条规则依赖了旧文件名或调用了旧命令，错误要等到结果文件内容不对时才暴露。\n\n因此消除重复不只是缩写，而是把隐含的一致性要求变成一处显式定义。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "repetition-cost"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "count-variable-makefile",
        "moduleId": "variable-solution",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "code",
        "title": "教材示例：用两个变量改写 Makefile",
        "markdown": "教材用与程序中相同的办法解决重复：定义并使用变量。改写后的完整文件如下。\n\n```makefile\n.PHONY : all clean\n\nCOUNT=bin/countwords.py\nRUN_COUNT=python $(COUNT)\n\n# Regenerate all results.\nall : results/moby_dick.csv results/jane_eyre.csv\n\n# Regenerate results for \"Moby Dick\"\nresults/moby_dick.csv : data/moby_dick.txt $(COUNT)\n\t$(RUN_COUNT) data/moby_dick.txt > results/moby_dick.csv\n\n# Regenerate results for \"Jane Eyre\"\nresults/jane_eyre.csv : data/jane_eyre.txt $(COUNT)\n\t$(RUN_COUNT) data/jane_eyre.txt > results/jane_eyre.csv\n\n# Remove all generated files.\nclean :\n\trm -f results/*.csv\n```",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "quote",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-dacd3293b5aedfe0e5a195bd",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000058"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Automating Analyses with Make",
                "Reducing Repetition in a Makefile"
              ],
              "lineStart": 5542,
              "lineEnd": 5606,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "e75cc3035dab32cc67d14b496965e3405aedd8748e67a71c981578f636ebcaa9"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "definition-and-expansion",
        "moduleId": "variable-solution",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "title": "补充：定义、引用与展开顺序",
        "markdown": "教材示例只用两个定义就收走了全部重复：`COUNT=bin/countwords.py` 记录程序位置，`RUN_COUNT=python $(COUNT)` 记录运行它的完整命令。定义的形式是 `NAME=value`，引用时写成 `$(NAME)`。\n\nMake 在执行命令前做替换：遇到 `$(RUN_COUNT)` 就展开为 `python bin/countwords.py`；而 `RUN_COUNT` 的值里又引用 `$(COUNT)`，所以 `COUNT` 改变后 `RUN_COUNT` 自动跟着改变。两条规则的依赖和命令都引用同一批变量，改名时只需要改 `COUNT` 一处。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "count-variable-makefile"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "definition-and-reference-rules",
        "moduleId": "syntax-boundary",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "note",
        "title": "定义形式与引用写法",
        "markdown": "每个变量定义占用一行，形式固定为 `NAME=value`。变量名按惯例写成大写，好与通常小写的文件名区分开，但 Make 并不强制大小写。强制的是引用方式：必须用括号写成 `$(NAME)`，不能直接写 `$NAME`。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-dacd3293b5aedfe0e5a195bd",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000058"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Automating Analyses with Make",
                "Reducing Repetition in a Makefile"
              ],
