            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "why-parentheses",
        "moduleId": "syntax-boundary",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "warning",
        "title": "为什么必须加括号",
        "markdown": "教材用一个小节专门解释括号的必要性：出于历史原因，Make 会把 `$NAME` 解释为一个名为 `N` 的变量，再接上三个字符 `AME`；如果不存在名为 `N` 的变量，`$NAME` 就变成 `AME`，几乎肯定不是作者想要的结果。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-dacd3293b5aedfe0e5a195bd",
              "blockIds": [
